lowers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":436,"digest":"sha256:77d55fdd6b8322c2990512a70d107ba6b18b949a0461a4ab01a8774c2d7bb24e","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-10-21T13:10:48Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T13:10:49Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/gzers/opencodex-desktop/releases/download/v0.2.1/OpenCodeX.Desktop_aarch64.app.tar.gz.sig"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gzers/opencodex-desktop/tarball/v0.2.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gzers/opencodex-desktop/zipball/v0.2.1","body":"修复管理器界面与已确认原型的还原差异（macOS Apple Silicon / Windows x64）。\n\n- 渠道与模版列表使用独立窄选择列，重新分配节点、版本和操作宽度；型号区合并筛选工具栏，减少重复名称与纵向留白。\n- 渠道详情操作回归侧栏，保存区保持在可用视口内；模版详情补齐来源、编辑基准和版本入口，图文按钮共用居中与间距配方。\n- 文件同步与 WebDAV 的对象范围、预设及凭据选项恢复在页面主体；连接设置按需打开，卡片间距统一。导出、上传、解密和比较采用仍分别确认，读取本机范围失败时不允许以默认值覆盖。\n- 模版列表与设置增加常驻 Agent 配置入口；画质和背景渲染使用公共分段单选，继续保存同一本机偏好。\n- 概览卡片的信息行统一字号、行高与点击内距；固定 Tab 的分隔贯穿整行，沿用透明玻璃材质。\n- 增加消费者样式防覆盖检查、同源组件样例和 Windows 原生页面几何回归，组件登记分别标明自动检查、未变原生基线和原型专用边界。\n\n账户支持、配置保存及安全边界沿用 0.2.0；不新增登录态迁移，也不自动采用模型配置。安装包延续未做系统代码签名／Apple 公证的测试分发策略，自更新资产仍独立签名并校验。\n\n---\n\n### 安装\n- macOS（Apple Silicon）：下载 `.dmg`，拖入「应用程序」。\n- Windows（x64）：下载 `*-setup.exe`（NSIS）安装包。\n- 均为未签名测试包：macOS 首次打开如被 Gatekeeper 拦截，右键 →「打开」；Windows SmartScreen 可能提示，选择「仍要运行」。"}